MT=91:  INELASTIC CONTINUUM NEUTRON CROSS SECTION                 9237 1451     
   Based on the GNASH Hauser-Feshbach statistical/preequilibrium  9237 1451     
calculations, described above. Note that MT=91 thresholds at 1.11 9237 1451     
MeV.  Therefore, discrete states with excitation energies above   9237 1451     
1.11 MeV (MT=72-90) lie in the MT=91 continuum region.            9237 1451     
