MT=102: NEUTRON RADIATIVE CAPTURE CROSS SECTION                   9237 1451     
   10 to 149 keV:  Based on the ENDF/B-VI (Release 8) unresolved  9237 1451     
resonance parameter evaluation by Froehner and Poenitz (see       9237 1451     
Fr88,Po81). That evaluation is based on a FITACS fit to the       9237 1451     
experimental data.                                                9237 1451     
   0.15 to 2.2 MeV:  Based on the simultaneous standards analysis 9237 1451     
by Pronyaev et al. (Pr05).                                        9237 1451     
   2.2 - 30 MeV:  Follows the JENDL-3.0 evaluation.  The results  9237 1451     
in the 8-14 MeV range agree closely with the measurements of      9237 1451     
McDaniels et al. (Mc82) and Drake et al. (Dr71).                  9237 1451     
