MT=18: A covariance matrix was evaluated for the prompt fission   9237 1451     
neutron spectrum (MF5,MT18) at 0.5 MeV incident neutron energy.   9237 1451     
A combination of Madland-Nix model calculations and experimental  9237 1451     
data (for U235) were used in a Bayesian filter to obtain the      9237 1451     
covariance matrix. The calculated spectrum was very close to the  9237 1451     
evaluated one, but the covariance matrix was still renormalized   9237 1451     
to insure the required zero-sum rule.                             9237 1451     
